<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="955720734"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:30.606"><div begin="4.166" end="13.601" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="4.166" end="10.402" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.166" end="4.826">不要</span><span begin="4.826" end="7.102">拖泥又带水</span> <span begin="7.455" end="8.041">不要</span><span begin="8.041" end="9.640">懒惰又浪</span><span begin="9.640" end="10.402">费</span></p><p begin="10.557" end="13.601" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.557" end="11.679">这就是</span><span begin="11.679" end="12.872">我的年</span><span begin="12.872" end="13.601">代</span></p></div><div begin="16.916" end="43.306" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="16.916" end="23.269" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.916" end="17.273">星</span><span begin="17.273" end="17.659">球</span><span begin="17.659" end="19.204">排成一条</span><span begin="19.204" end="20.049">线</span> <span begin="20.222" end="20.878">现在</span><span begin="20.878" end="22.428">该趁热打</span><span begin="22.428" end="23.269">铁</span></p><p begin="23.363" end="33.758" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.363" end="24.024">我的</span><span begin="24.024" end="25.677">梦不是未</span><span begin="25.677" end="26.441">来</span> <span begin="27.028" end="27.374">就</span><span begin="27.374" end="28.196">是</span><span begin="28.196" end="28.625">现</span><span begin="28.625" end="33.758">在</span></p><p begin="36.130" end="43.306" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.130" end="36.606">我</span><span begin="36.606" end="36.731">的</span><span begin="36.731" end="38.384">梦不是未</span><span begin="38.384" end="39.148">来</span> <span begin="39.735" end="40.081">就</span><span begin="40.081" end="40.903">是</span><span begin="40.903" end="41.332">现</span><span begin="41.332" end="43.306">在</span></p></div><div begin="43.903" end="56.356" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.903" end="47.100" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.903" end="45.215">千禧年的前夕</span> <span begin="45.215" end="46.447">我在录音室哭</span><span begin="46.447" end="47.100">泣</span></p><p begin="47.143" end="50.338" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.143" end="48.207">累积的潜力</span> <span begin="48.207" end="49.625">都是岁月留的痕</span><span begin="49.625" end="50.338">迹</span></p><p begin="50.361" end="53.483" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.361" end="51.270">哪里有龙</span> <span begin="51.270" end="52.823">我就往哪里努力点</span><span begin="52.823" end="53.483">睛</span></p><p begin="53.622" end="56.356" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.622" end="56.084">但我的梦想就像谈不成的恋</span><span begin="56.084" end="56.356">情</span></p></div><div begin="56.366" end="1:09.213" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="56.366" end="59.556" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.366" end="56.592">像</span><span begin="56.592" end="56.829">摸</span><span begin="56.829" end="56.929">不</span><span begin="56.929" end="57.198">着</span><span begin="57.198" end="57.628">的星星</span> <span begin="57.628" end="58.236">就像罗</span><span begin="58.236" end="58.482">小</span><span begin="58.482" end="58.582">虎</span><span begin="58.582" end="58.821">和</span><span begin="58.821" end="59.051">子</span><span begin="59.051" end="59.556">怡</span></p><p begin="59.622" end="1:02.714" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.622" end="59.993">临门</span><span begin="59.993" end="1:00.106">一</span><span begin="1:00.106" end="1:00.427">脚</span> <span begin="1:00.427" end="1:00.806">靠近</span> <span begin="1:00.806" end="1:01.417">但最后</span><span begin="1:01.417" end="1:01.662">只</span><span begin="1:01.662" end="1:01.787">感</span><span begin="1:01.787" end="1:02.069">受</span><span begin="1:02.069" end="1:02.320">打</span><span begin="1:02.320" end="1:02.714">击</span></p><p begin="1:02.836" end="1:05.901" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.836" end="1:03.206">生命</span><span begin="1:03.206" end="1:03.347">是</span><span begin="1:03.347" end="1:03.525">自</span><span begin="