end="2:03.855">我已</span><span begin="2:03.855" end="2:04.271">数</span><span begin="2:04.271" end="2:04.857">不清</span><span begin="2:04.857" end="2:06.906">有多少的眼</span><span begin="2:06.906" end="2:07.648">泪</span></p><p begin="2:07.781" end="2:13.521" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.781" end="2:08.520">我也</span><span begin="2:08.520" end="2:09.059">数</span><span begin="2:09.059" end="2:09.273">不</span><span begin="2:09.273" end="2:09.837">清</span><span begin="2:09.837" end="2:09.998">有</span><span begin="2:09.998" end="2:10.649">几</span><span begin="2:10.649" end="2:11.254">次的</span><span begin="2:11.254" end="2:11.858">跌</span><span begin="2:11.858" end="2:13.521">倒</span></p><p begin="2:15.791" end="2:20.245" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.791" end="2:16.223">每</span><span begin="2:16.223" end="2:17.072">次的</span><span begin="2:17.072" end="2:17.651">失败</span> <span begin="2:17.651" end="2:18.275">和</span><span begin="2:18.275" end="2:18.649">每</span><span begin="2:18.649" end="2:19.243">次的</span><span begin="2:19.243" end="2:19.594">打</span><span begin="2:19.594" end="2:20.245">击</span></p><p begin="2:20.458" end="2:26.264" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.458" end="2:20.679">以</span><span begin="2:20.679" end="2:21.097">前</span><span begin="2:21.097" end="2:21.294">以</span><span begin="2:21.294" end="2:21.840">为</span><span begin="2:22.270" end="2:22.829">都</span><span begin="2:22.829" end="2:23.021">是</span><span begin="2:23.021" end="2:23.472">自</span><span begin="2:23.472" end="2:23.698">己</span><span begin="2:23.698" end="2:24.023">不</span><span begin="2:24.023" end="2:24.625">够</span><span begin="2:24.625" end="2:26.264">好</span></p></div><div begin="2:26.620" end="2:39.058" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:26.620" end="2:35.158" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.620" end="2:28.846">但忽然这一刻</span> <span begin="2:28.846" end="2:32.420">看全世界都变了</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="2: